# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# kinds.mkind - Swedish-pack kind-atom localization (Phase 8).
#
# Each line is "<canonical>[.<agree>...] <localized>". The canonical is the
# ontology leaf name (English convention - see LOJ1897_Scripts/Merlin/ontology/
# Concepts.mon); the localized is the Swedish surface form the realize layer
# emits when a [k <canonical>] atom is rendered. A kind without an entry falls
# back to the canonical hstr (so a missing translation is visible but not
# broken).
#
# Phase 8.1 - kinship nouns carry a grammatical-gender agreement tag (.cg for
# common / "en"-words, .nt for neuter / "ett"-words). The data is wired up so
# kind_word_grammatical_features() can return a noun's gender at lookup time;
# DEFERRED until the realize layer gains a peek-ahead mechanism is the
# possessive-pronoun selection (min/mitt/mina) that consumes this data. The
# tags are harmless until then - the lookup picks the bare entry as the
# unmarked default in every Swedish call site.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Nationality
irish           irländsk
english         engelsk
french          fransk
st-revieran     st_reviersk

# Class
upper           över
middle          medel
lower           arbetar

# Interest
literature      litteratur
music           musik
theatre         teater
riding          ridning
history         historia
science         vetenskap
spiritualism    spiritism
religion        religion
antiques        antikviteter
sports          sport
suffrage        rösträtt

# Sport disciplines
cricket         cricket
rowing          rodd
rugby           rugby
horse-racing    hästkapplöpning

# Job
editor          redaktör
printer         tryckare
journalist      journalist
banker          bankir
landlord        hyresvärd
industrialist   industriman
principal       rektor
merchant        köpman
apothecary      apotekare
proprietor      ägare
solicitor       advokat
physician       läkare
priest          präst
clerk           kontorist
teacher         lärare
engineer        ingenjör
surgeon         kirurg
typist          maskinskrivare
barber          barberare
gardener        trädgårdsmästare
cook            kock
farmer          bonde
nurse           sjuksköterska
steward         förvaltare
shop-clerk      butiksbiträde
waiter          servitör
maid            hembiträde
bartender       bartender
factory-worker  fabriksarbetare
house-agent     mäklare
official        ämbetsman
hatmaker        hattmakare
tailor          skräddare
baker           bagare

# Gender
male            man
female          kvinna

# Gambling / substances
gambling        hasardspel
alcohol         alkohol

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Phase 8.1 - grammatical gender on kinship nouns. Tags drive future
# possessive-pronoun agreement (min/mitt/mina) once the realize layer can
# look ahead at the next noun hole's binding.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Kinship - bare nouns. The kinship-relation REL templates currently embed
# these strings directly in Statements.mgr (mor / far / syster / ...) so these
# entries serve as the gender-feature source rather than the surface form.
mother.cg       mor
father.cg       far
parent.cg       förälder
sibling.nt      syskon
brother.cg      bror
sister.cg       syster
child.nt        barn
son.cg          son
daughter.cg     dotter
spouse.cg       make
husband.cg      make
wife.cg         fru
fiancee.cg      fästmö
friend.cg       vän
neighbour.cg    granne
